BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261011T132500
DURATION:PT2H
SUMMARY:onlyspx notebooks: portability fix + codespace-run pipeline
UID:1e0fd35e-a71e-45d2-922b-96e69dff5fa2@1e0f.org
DESCRIPTION:Created a Colab notebook mirror repo\; converted notebooks to 
 .py\;\nfixed Colab-only API-key loading (env var with Colab 
 fallback)\;\nstored the data API key as a Codespaces secret\; repaired a 
 broken\nindentation in the live notebook and remirrored\; verified a 
 full\nend-to-end run with real market data in a codespace. Weekday 6am 
 and\n9:45am runs moved off Colab to the browser-driven codespace path 
 via\na selective cell runner.
DTSTAMP:20261013T114717Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261012T060000
DURATION:PT30M
SUMMARY:First live onlyspx codespace runs — completed
UID:84f9676b-b98b-4529-9e24-3948d0f040b2@84f9.org
DESCRIPTION:Weekday 6am pivots and 9:45am gap reports ran from a codespace 
 via\nthe browser path for the first time. The 6am run recovered after 
 a\nsign-in issue\; the gap run succeeded on retry. Premarket and 
 gap\nposts were published across the text platforms\, and image 
 posts\nwere published on the photo and video platforms. Exact-
 format\npremarket and gap publishing SOPs were locked in.
DTSTAMP:20261013T114717Z
END:VEVENT
