SUMMARY:onlyspx notebooks: stitching and run-output fixes
UID:1f85589e-a320-4e55-aeb3-95251efad9e8@1f85.org
DESCRIPTION:Fixed the intraday-range history pull to use the point-in-
 time\nfront-month contract for each date (plain splice\, no\nback-
 adjustment)\, giving full sessions across the roll instead of\nthin back-
 month bars. Also added the RTH open and volume print to\nthe run output so
  publishing is self-contained. Repo and live\nnotebook copies synced\; the
  next scheduled run is the live proof.
DTSTAMP:20261013T114717Z
END:VEVENT
