UID:b30710c3-a92a-4965-bca3-88eed0d24164@b307.org
DESCRIPTION:Weekly rotation review selected no papers for the 
 third\nconsecutive week\, with all candidates rejected on page-
 health\ngrounds. A spot check suggests the health check uses stale 
 data.\nThe notification email could not be sent because the agent 
 mailbox\nis disabled. Decision needed: fix the health check or suspend 
 the\nreview while the rotation campaigns remain paused. Nothing 
 was\napplied to Ads.
DTSTAMP:20261013T114717Z
END:VEVENT
