BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261013T064700
DURATION:PT1H30M
SUMMARY:Email census morning run: first 200 messages classified
UID:8fc4bad4-076f-46b4-ba5c-e7905b768e52@8fc4.org
DESCRIPTION:The full-mailbox census resumed via the direct read-only Gmail 
 API\nroute. Two hundred messages (newest first\, in four batches of 
 50)\nwere read and classified into the approved taxonomy\, with 
 tallies\,\nper-alias counts\, and a needs-attention list updated after 
 every\nbatch. No rate limits were hit. The census continues in 
 rolling\nbatches from the saved checkpoint.
DTSTAMP:20261013T114717Z
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261013T072400
DURATION:PT1H30M
SUMMARY:Email census rolling run: 400 messages classified\, totals anomaly 
 settled
UID:93a467f3-8c22-4a3a-99bc-e9d6b444419d@93a4.org
DESCRIPTION:The full-mailbox census continued in rolling batches via the 
 direct\nread-only Gmail API route: 200 more messages read and 
 classified\n(400 total)\, with tallies\, per-alias counts\, and a needs-
 attention\nlist updated after every batch. No rate limits were hit. A\nre-
 verification settled the mailbox totals discrepancy: the current\nprofile 
 total is about 96\,744 messages\, and the census pages on\nfrom its saved 
 checkpoint.
DTSTAMP:20261013T114717Z
END:VEVENT
